Bash: `"$HOME/.demarkus/bin/demarkus-plugin" provision detect`. Non-zero exit: surface it, stop; never read a failed inspection as "not running". Output: `NO_SERVER`, or `SERVERS` then one `PID PORT ROOT` row per reusable server; a `SKIPPED` block may follow either, its rows carrying their reason: show them, never offer them. Any other shape: surface it, stop.